<title>JAPAN: Nitsuko - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nitsuko - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 36.62		vs	   32.67</p>
<p> Operating	  951    million	  vs	  644    million</p>
<p> Current	    910    million	  vs	  766    million</p>
<p> Net		  515    million	  vs	  430    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.75 yen	  vs	    4.79 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     90 million	  vs	  90 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nitsuko Corp is a leading manufacturer of telephones and belongs to the NEC group.</p>
</text>
